          "type": "body",
          "settings": {
            "body_text": "<p>This is a steel tongue rain drum: a weather-ready instrument designed to sit outdoors.</p><p>Nine steel tongues are cut so raindrops land on clear, pleasant notes. On dry days, use the included mallet to play it yourself.</p><p>Place it under a drip edge, gutter, or a branch that keeps dripping after a storm, and let the rain do the rest.</p>",
            "body_size": 18,
